  "adaptations": [
    "0031: retain bounded MTP-window sizing and eviction only; omit tail caps and depth-cutoff resizing.",
    "0031: require MTP and nonempty batch; use 64-bit sizing arithmetic.",
    "0041: place the graph begin/step/end hooks in e3de715 without importing optional op-timing code.",
    "0070: preserve ARC-LAB SYCL replay; use a separate raw CUDA API and serialized state tag 3.",
    "0070: require CUDA backend and F32 recurrent state/raw gates; validate saved pending counts and bound device counts.",
    "DSpine: port four C++ inference files only; omit conversion and quantization tooling.",
    "DSpine: recover selected borrowed output rows with normalized Hadamard, then signs; reuse build_embd_rows for tied inverse maps.",
    "DSpine: reject incomplete bridges, invalid dimensions, non-causal or mixed draft architectures, and permuted output heads.",
    "DSpine: apply output scaling and logit transforms to both initial logits and refined candidate scores.",
    "DSpine: preserve dflash.attention.causal in the old speculative runner; the upstream base already has this fix."
  ],
